  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes I want to let someone use a private avatar for fun just for messing around, but right now I have to trust that they'll disable cloning in settings, then take off my headset and republish it as public, and then publish it as private again after they clone it, and hope that no one else walked into the room and cloned it in the meantime.\n\nIt'd be nice if we could invite users to wear a private avatar temporarily (wears off once they disconnect or change worlds).",
